<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance comparison of translating English into Chinese with open-source and close-source MLLMs on the MCiTon <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">61</a>]</cite> test set.
We report <span id="S4.T2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BLEU/COMET</span> for translation quality of each real-world scenarios.
<math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math> indicates higher is better.
The <span id="S4.T2.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> represents the best results, and the <span id="S4.T2.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underline</span> represents the second best results.</span></figcaption>
